{
  "name": "oil-gas-analyst",
  "description": "Oil-and-gas market analyst chat: OPEC demand, live quotes, and Brent forecasts grounded in reports, the open web, or computation rather than invented figures. Conversation is driven by the Ouroboros agent runtime (not LangGraph); the Streamlit dashboard on port 8000 is the chat UI and adapter, with reviewed skills for report search, denylisted web search, and forecasting, and /evolve disabled in light runtime mode. Inventory is large (150 files); treat docs and .scratch tickets as out of scope unless you are mapping product decisions or agent workflows.",
